    title: Levelized Cost of Energy
    description: |-
      Lazard's Levelized Cost of Energy+ (LCOE+) is a U.S.-focused annual publication that combines analyses across different reports: Energy (LCOE), Storage, (LCOS) and Hydrogen (LCOH). Lazard first started publishing its comparative analysis of various generation technologies in 2007.
